# Moodle's coding style requires Unix line endings, and phpcs reports
# Generic.Files.LineEndings when it finds CRLF. Windows Git converts LF to
# CRLF on checkout by default (core.autocrlf=true), which would undo the
# conversion and hand the reviewer CRLF files from a repository that looks
# clean locally. This makes the repository authoritative: LF in, LF out,
# on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing here is text, whatever the extension says.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
